1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,970
But an honest detective does not believe in ghosts.

2
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:11,130
He looked closely at the latch, and at the small puddle by the bath.

3
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:15,750
The trick was a large wedge carved out of ice.

4
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:20,930
The ice held the latch raised for a few short minutes.

5
00:00:20,930 --> 00:00:26,950
The killer drew the ice out on a thin line, or simply let it melt.

6
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:32,550
Once the ice was gone, gravity dropped the latch on its own.

7
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:38,570
The room became an impossible locked room, sealed without a trace.
